From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 19:24:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/apple: m4: add an XDR guard for panel levels
 above the user maximum

An XDR panel takes levels above its user maximum: EDR highlights and,
in bright surroundings, a raised SDR ceiling up to the aurora maximum
(1000 nits on the J604, what macOS sustains). Whether the 26.6.2
firmware takes such a level in a swap is not known, and a swap it
refuses fails the session: the panel stays black until a reboot.

Add the guard as pure functions: a level above the user maximum is
asked for only as far as the firmware has been seen to take one, up a
ladder of 200 nit rungs. 48 taken swaps in a row at a rung (A407
answered, D590 within 250 ms and, once a D590 has said so for an
ordinary swap, displayed) take the highest level they asked for and
open the next rung; three in a row that stall or are not displayed,
or one that fails, refuse it: every level goes back at once to the
last one taken and stays there. Thermal mitigation caps every level,
one 100 nit step per cooling state, never below the ADT thermal
minimum cap.

A KUnit suite covers the ladder, each way back, that ordinary swaps
never move it, the thermal cap and starting over.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
(cherry picked from commit 24e928e675a52912c37fda9118d4dc34b8a136f4)
(cherry picked from commit 7dba4077b30503f503309c6ecf7f36ead8470780)
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/Makefile          |   1 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/dcp-m4-xdr-test.c | 279 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/dcp-m4-xdr.h      | 218 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 498 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/dcp-m4-xdr-test.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/dcp-m4-xdr.h

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/Makefile b/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/Makefile
index 9fa470fcb5..e13932edbc 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/Makefile
@@ -33,6 +33,7 @@ appledrm-$(CONFIG_DRM_APPLE_KUNIT_TEST) += dcp-panel-edid-test.o
 appledrm-$(CONFIG_DRM_APPLE_KUNIT_TEST) += dcp-panel-adt-test.o
 appledrm-$(CONFIG_DRM_APPLE_KUNIT_TEST) += dcp-m4-edr-test.o
 appledrm-$(CONFIG_DRM_APPLE_KUNIT_TEST) += dcp-m4-frame-test.o
+appledrm-$(CONFIG_DRM_APPLE_KUNIT_TEST) += dcp-m4-xdr-test.o
 appledrm-y += iomfb_v26_6.o iomfb_v26_6_link.o j613_dcp_activate.o
 appledrm-y += epic/dpavservep.o
